      "progressUpdateIntervalMs": 500,
      "jobName": "paragraph_1795824000004_904512370",
      "id": "20261123-090004_904512370",
      "dateCreated": "2026-11-23 09:00:00.000",
      "status": "FINISHED",
      "results": {
        "code": "SUCCESS",
        "msg": [
          {
            "type": "HTML",
            "data": "<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Étape 1 — Observer</h3>\n<p>Ouvrez http://localhost:8088 : <em>Cluster Metrics</em> (mémoire et vcores totaux), <em>Nodes</em>, <em>Scheduler</em>. Puis comparez avec la ligne de commande et l'API REST ci-dessous.</p>\n<p>Rappel de la configuration du lab (<code>hadoop/config</code>, <code>spark/hadoop-conf/mapred-site.xml</code>) :</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Paramètre</th>\n<th>Valeur</th>\n<th>Rôle</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>yarn.nodemanager.resource.memory-mb</code></td>\n<td>4096 (3072 en version légère)</td>\n<td>mémoire que le nœud offre aux conteneurs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>yarn.nodemanager.resource.cpu-vcores</code></td>\n<td>8 (4 en version légère)</td>\n<td>vcores offerts</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>yarn.scheduler.minimum-allocation-mb</code> / <code>maximum-allocation-mb</code></td>\n<td>256 / 4096</td>\n<td>plus petit et plus grand conteneur accordés</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>yarn.app.mapreduce.am.resource.mb</code></td>\n<td>512</td>\n<td>ApplicationMaster MapReduce</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>mapreduce.map.memory.mb</code> / <code>mapreduce.map.java.opts</code></td>\n<td>512 / <code>-Xmx410m</code></td>\n<td>conteneur map et tas Java (≈ 80 %)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>yarn.scheduler.capacity.resource-calculator</code></td>\n<td><code>DominantResourceCalculator</code></td>\n<td>mémoire <strong>et</strong> vcores sont comptés</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>"
          }
        ]
      },
      "dateStarted": "2026-11-23 09:00:00.000",
      "dateFinished": "2026-11-23 09:00:00.000"
    },
    {
      "title": "1.1 Capacité du cluster",
      "text": "%sh\nyarn node -list -showDetails 2>/dev/null | grep -E 'Node-Id|Total-Nodes|Configured Resources|Allocated Resources|Resource Utilization'\ncurl -s http://resourcemanager:8088/ws/v1/cluster/metrics | python3 -c \"\nimport json, sys; m = json.load(sys.stdin)['clusterMetrics']\nprint(f\\\"mémoire : {m['totalMB']} Mo au total, {m['availableMB']} Mo libres | vcores : {m['totalVirtualCores']} | nœuds actifs : {m['activeNodes']} | applications en cours : {m['appsRunning']}\\\")\"\nyarn queue -status default 2>/dev/null | grep -E 'Queue Name|State|Capacity'",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-11-23 09:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
